<title>USA: San Antonio feeder cattle not well tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>San Antonio feeder cattle not well tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Not enough cattle were on offer for a good market test, compared to Monday, USDA said.</p>
<p>Bulk of supply Medium and Large 1-2 300-600 lb feeder steers and heifers. Supply included 2 percent cows and bulls and 24 percent feeder cattle over 600 lbs. Receipts - 289    Last Week - 447   Last Year - 1,654</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 - 600-700 lbs 73.00-76.50; pkg 710 lbs 70.25; pkg 903 lbs 70.25. Medium and Large 1-2 - few 500-525 lbs 75.25; pkg 780 lbs 66.00; pkg 835 lbs 65.00.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 - 600-700 lbs 71.00-75.00; few 700-750 lbs 69.50-70.50; few 800-850 lbs 69.50-72.50. Medium and Large 1-2 - 500-600 lbs 68.50-71.50; few 600-675 lbs 66.50-67.50; pkg 825 lbs 57.00.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
